    <description>ALF-RS-09 - Get Payment on Invoice Summary. The only path a Sales Rep has to add a Payment to a deal now that Record Payment has been removed - pulls a payment by its Keyloop reference (simulated pending a live Keyloop integration - see AF_KeyloopGetPayment) and creates it against this Invoice Summary. Loops back to let the rep pull another payment immediately, since a deal is very often settled across more than one payment before it reaches Fully Paid.</description>
